  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div><ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> vuông tại <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>B</mi></semantics></math> có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math> vuông tại <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>C</mi></semantics></math> có <div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>C</mi><msup><mi>′</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div></li><li>Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>I</mi></semantics></math> là trung điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"ht